    "baseRefOid": "c7acbbd6e6445cdc8a803898959c1dcbc41ecb62",
    "body": "## Summary\n- Correct BR-RULE-294 UC-019 targeting-rehydration BDD expectations from off-spec `INTERNAL_ERROR` to `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE`, matching production (`media_buy_list.py`) and the existing unit pin.\n- No production or step-wiring changes; scenarios remain dormant (unbound → auto-xfail) until separately wired.\n- Orthogonal **suggestion** field gap tracked as follow-up leaf #1646 (blocked by this issue) so #1571 closes with no leftover debt.\n\n## Spec / grounding\n- Production advisory uses standard wire code `SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE` + `TARGETING_REHYDRATION_FAILED:` message prefix (`src/core/tools/media_buy_list.py`).\n- `INTERNAL_ERROR` is internal-only / not buyer-facing for this path.\n- Storyboard grading for this advisory path: ungraded; behavior pinned by `test_corrupted_targeting_surfaces_via_errors_channel`.\n\nCloses #1571\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `rg` hygiene: no `INTERNAL_ERROR` in BR-RULE-294 targeting windows\n- [x] `uv run pytest tests/unit/test_get_media_buys.py -k corrupted_targeting -q`\n- [ ] CI green on PR",
    "canBeRebased": false,
